/os/path

+ host-target-name = "linux"

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ do apple-sdk-path Path ?! Error
    - sdk String?

` Apple SDKs come with Xcode, which a Linux host does not have.
?! Error("Apple SDKs are only on macOS; on Linux, build for an Apple target with --object-only and --c-headers, given a snapshot a Mac wrote with --record-c-headers")

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ do apple-linker-path String ?! Error

` Apple's linker comes with Xcode, which a Linux host does not have.
?! Error("Apple's linker is only on macOS; on Linux, build for an Apple target with --object-only")
